<v Sarah Gibson>And then they go to the house of someone they grew up with-- Nick Avery. Their kids went to school together.
<v Sarah Gibson>然后她们去了她们一起长大的一个人——尼克·艾弗里的家。他们的孩子曾经一起上学。

